SAB & Deluge Card is a focused Home Assistant dashboard card created by
Travis Matzdorf.

Its visual design and portions of its interaction patterns are derived from
Arr Stack Card by martinargalas:
https://github.com/martinargalas/ha-arr-stack-card

The card uses Arr Stack Integration as its authenticated Home Assistant API
proxy:
https://github.com/martinargalas/arr-stack-integration

